    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I’ve been looking back at my work lately... everything I wanted to achieve, every note I wanted to hit, every theory I wanted to prove... it's all done. I feel like I’ve reached the summit of the mountain and there’s nothing left but the descent. The view is beautiful, but the air is getting thin and the descent looks so long and exhausting.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
