      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of reaching a major milestone is exhilarating, even if the next phase feels daunting. It's natural to experience a sense of void after accomplishing big goals, which is often called a \"post-climax slump.\" Perhaps this descent isn't an ending, but a shift toward mastering a new, less visible landscape, like mentoring, refining your craft's influence, or exploring completely different questions. Use this plateau to appreciate the incredible vantage point you’ve earned before planning your next horizon.",
